  "body": "11C Mimosa Place | 4 Bedrooms | 2.5 Bathrooms | Internal Garage + 2 Off-Street Parks\r\n\r\nBrand New! CCC Issued! Ready to Move In!\r\n\r\nYour dream home awaits in one of East Auckland's most desirable and sought-after locations! Combining modern sophistication, everyday comfort, low-maintenance living and access to exceptional schooling, this stunning brand-new residence presents an outstanding opportunity for families, professionals and savvy investors alike.\r\n\r\nWith Christmas just around the corner, why wait? Secure your brand-new home now and celebrate Christmas in style!\r\n\r\nKey Features You'll Love\r\n\r\nBrand-New Contemporary Living: Beautifully designed with modern finishes, stylish interiors and a practical layout, offering the perfect balance of elegance, functionality and comfort.\r\n\r\nFour Generous Bedrooms: Thoughtfully arranged to accommodate growing families, visiting guests or those seeking a dedicated home office.\r\n\r\n2.5 Modern Bathrooms: Designed for everyday convenience, including an additional guest toilet for added practicality.\r\n\r\nModern Kitchen with Gas Cooking: Enjoy the pleasure of cooking with gas, complemented by a gas hot water system for efficient everyday living.\r\n\r\nPrivate, Low-Maintenance Backyard: Your own peaceful outdoor retreat, ideal for weekend relaxation, children's play or entertaining family and friends without the burden of extensive maintenance.\r\n\r\nInternal Access Garage + Two Off-Street Parks: A fantastic combination of security, convenience and valuable additional parking space.\r\n\r\nEducation Excellence - Prestigious School Zones!\r\n\r\nLocation is everything, and this property truly delivers when it comes to education!\r\n\r\nEnjoy access to some of East Auckland's most highly regarded schools, including:\r\n\r\nPigeon Mountain Primary School\r\nBucklands Beach Intermediate\r\nMacleans College - One of Auckland's most sought-after secondary schools!\r\n\r\nFor families who value quality education and long-term lifestyle benefits, this location is simply exceptional.\r\n\r\nA Lifestyle Location You'll Fall in Love With!\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned to enjoy the best of the Eastern Bays lifestyle, this beautiful home offers convenient access to the stunning Half Moon Bay Marina, where waterfront dining, cafés, scenic walks and the local market create a wonderful coastal atmosphere.\r\n\r\nWith local shopping, parks, recreational facilities and everyday amenities nearby, you'll enjoy the perfect combination of convenience, community and relaxed seaside living.\r\n\r\nWhether you're heading out for a morning coffee, enjoying a waterfront stroll or spending quality time with loved ones, everything you need is within easy reach.\r\n\r\nCCC ISSUED - NO BUILDING DELAYS, NO WAITING!\r\n\r\nWhy settle for an older home when you can enjoy the fresh beginnings, modern comfort and peace of mind that come with a brand-new property?\r\n\r\nWith the Code Compliance Certificate (CCC) already issued, this property is ready for its first proud owners.\r\n\r\nA brand-new home. A prestigious school zone. A superb coastal lifestyle. All wrapped up in one irresistible opportunity!\r\n\r\nYOUR NEW HOME FOR CHRISTMAS - DON'T MISS OUT!\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure a brand-new four-bedroom home in the highly desirable Macleans College zone are not to be overlooked.\r\n\r\nMake this Christmas extra special - move into your dream home and start creating unforgettable family memories!\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing or visit our open home. Your exciting new chapter starts at 11C Mimosa Place!",
